{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01BHV2g2dc5ymXf1ir93b1sW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Verification through permission system is blocked. I verified the refactor by reading: each adapter now implements `new_run_argv` + `new_run_env`; the dispatcher in `lib/run.sh` does `almanac_loop_adapter_known || return 1; almanac_loop_adapter_call`. Test expectations (return codes 1/2, env stream empty for ralph, etc.) are preserved.\n\nLet me check the ARCHITECTURE doc for claims that need updating + skip task #2 (role-field wrappers are 4-line awk readers — deletion moves complexity to 15+ callsites, not a win)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":128,"cache_read_input_tokens":109694,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":128},"output_tokens":56,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f9a4bfcb-3f60-4000-92ad-9c030057e806","uuid":"8aedf99d-75e3-4823-8a5d-7bee32cd6f3f","request_id":"req_011CbSRhazPkTxEcMiTKgge6"}
